      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 3.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "hello, come in. Mind the step"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.32,
      "end_seconds": 8.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Well, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.96,
      "end_seconds": 11.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "what's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.94,
      "end_seconds": 20.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a clicking in the breastbone, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.38,
      "end_seconds": 25.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "alright, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.16,
      "end_seconds": 45.98,
      "duration_seconds": 18.82,
      "text": "uh it's been like this since Friday i told myself I'd wait and see and here I am i did have pain in my breastbone wound at one point but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.4,
      "end_seconds": 50.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "okay, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.6,
      "end_seconds": 53.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.43,
      "end_seconds": 59.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "what do you take on a a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.4,
      "end_seconds": 69.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "actually, I take something called meto... metoprolol, 50 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.71,
      "end_seconds": 76.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.26,
      "end_seconds": 81.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "not with me i'll bring it next time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.67,
      "end_seconds": 92.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.03,
      "end_seconds": 94.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No surgery no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.21,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "okay, who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.84,
      "end_seconds": 101.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.46,
      "end_seconds": 105.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.24,
      "end_seconds": 111.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.62,
      "end_seconds": 115.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.79,
      "end_seconds": 121.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "mm, I've had heart disease, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.65,
      "end_seconds": 126.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "mm-hmm a few quick ones: fever, chest pain on exertion or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.47,
      "end_seconds": 135.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Um, I haven't had fever, chest pain on exertion or breathlessness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.38,
      "end_seconds": 140.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "right, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.74,
      "end_seconds": 144.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "erm, no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 159.77,
      "end_seconds": 168.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temp 36.8 degrees, pulse 79, BP is 120 over 76, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.99,
      "end_seconds": 171.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.98,
      "end_seconds": 176.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.51,
      "end_seconds": 178.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "okay doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.49,
      "end_seconds": 181.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.64,
      "end_seconds": 198.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "the chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.76,
      "end_seconds": 212.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably recovering well after bypass surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.48,
      "end_seconds": 215.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.43,
      "end_seconds": 225.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with recovering well after bypass surgery do well once it's treated properly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.3,
      "end_seconds": 246.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Blood tests is what I'd like next, for post-operative review. I'll request an ECG, it'll help with post-operative review"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.55,
      "end_seconds": 249.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.79,
      "end_seconds": 269.99,
      "duration_seconds": 20.2,
      "text": "walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Let's plan a check in six weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.16,
      "end_seconds": 275.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Good I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.16,
      "end_seconds": 283.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.09,
      "end_seconds": 290.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.37,
      "end_seconds": 296.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.8,
      "end_seconds": 301.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "okay that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.72,
      "end_seconds": 303.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
